   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS07:d4",
   "ptr": "0xd4",
   "len": 43,
   "jp": "シノブ\\n「リールは？\\n  ・・・大丈夫なの？」\\n",
   "en": "\"What about Riel? ...Is she going to be all right?\"",
